<title>JORDAN: Jordan dinar overnight rates drops to 6.09 percent.</title>
<headline>Jordan dinar overnight rates drops to 6.09 percent.</headline>
<dateline>AMMAN 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The weighted average overnight interbank rate on the Jordanian dinar fell to 6.09 percent on Tuesday from 6.85 percent on Monday, the Central Bank said.</p>
<p>It said five banks traded on the market in ten reported transactions with a total value of 11.2 million dinars ($16 million).</p>
<p>$1 = 0.708 dinar</p>
<p>-- Amman newsroom +962 6 623 776</p>
